<body>
    <h1>Sunlife (SSO)</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<ul>
 <li>Sail point on prem for authentication is done at Sunlife , which then =
feeds into Azure AD.</li>
 <li>Azure AD to Okta integration already exists for other applications at =
Sunlife.</li>
 <li>Okta to Okta integration is not required for this set up.</li>
 <li>Main attributes passed is email , First name , last name , additional =
attributes like business title etc. needed by some applications.</li>
 <li>Landing Page on compass SSO to be same or could change , depending on =
where the user is on the portal , for now one location at Sunlife to the sa=
me destination location at Compass for all the users is the proposed soluti=
on.</li>
 <li>Starting point would be to able to login to Compass , when new advisor=
s are added . Down the line , context with roles automatically set up is th=
e future road map.</li>
 <li>All access management to be done on Compass.</li>
 <li>Identity management at compass could have the capability to work with =
security stewards on Sunlife side and then apply the relevant roles accordi=
ngly , this is work in progress with other clients of NBIN.</li>
 <li>Phil and some one from Sunlife Ops team to participate in more detaile=
d architecture of SSO with NBIN.</li>
 <li>Two environments exist at NBIN , Preview ( pre =E2=80=93 prod ) and Pr=
od &nbsp;&nbsp;, Sign in URL=E2=80=99s could be made available for Dev , Te=
st , UAT , if required.</li>
 <li>No Audit or reporting required from Sunlife on SSO</li>
 <li>JM to set up another connect for Oct 20 ( already done).</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<ul>
 <li>API on NBIN compass side which could be exposed to SLF for off boardin=
g</li>
 <li>Profile deactivation will happen after set time ( 6 months )</li>
 <li>Profile not deleted after 6 months , JIT provisioning at NBIN facilita=
tes this use case</li>
 <li>After 6 months profile goes from okta , remains on compass and JIT pro=
visioning allows the profile to be recreated</li>
 <li>After set period of inactivity , profile will be deleted</li>
 <li>Initial preferences which are set up for advisors initially will remai=
n even if there is no activity for 6 months</li>
 <li>IDP IP=E2=80=99s to be whitelisted , SLF to send this information</li>
 <li>If user is not set up in compass and SSO , a new page with error messa=
ge to appear =E2=80=93 =E2=80=98You are not configured on compass=E2=80=99 =
. This could be configured</li>
 <li>Tracey Randell to be engaged for user experience page on compass from =
Sunlife</li>
 <li>context passing not in scope for now &nbsp;, data won=E2=80=99t be mov=
ed to compass platform .</li>
 <li>SAML and OIDC are approved at SunLife , Okta can support both and lot =
of OIDC . OIDC is working with SunLife</li>
 <li>Attribute such as language and others to be checked by Phil &nbsp;, if=
 possible to be sent .</li>
 <li>Timelines =E2=80=93 4 months implementation for SSO , by March 1<sup>s=
t</sup> ( tentative )</li>
 <li>Advisors could access compass using user id / password in prod , SSO t=
o be implemented around March 1 .</li>
 <li>Cost =E2=80=93 high right now . Estimates to be provided soon.</li>
</ul>
    </div>
